{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026亞太區經濟合作組織（APEC）財政部長會一連兩日在港舉行，政府稱會議圓滿舉行，各成員經濟體和國際組織的代表就多個區域經濟發展的重大議題展開深入交流，形成廣泛共識和務實成果。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:34.982046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T18:57:42.414112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:40.197711+00:00","content_hash":"9d02a39a3a926c22c33c63ea17908075be4a695c589128ef8a78940f8939c6aa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}